# F1/F2/F4/F5/F6/F7 — TWO REAL git repositories, never a stub.
#
# Layout mirrors production exactly, because the production layout IS the defect (R-C):
#     <root>/                                             harness repo, branch `main`
#     <root>/memory/projects/.harness-runner.<slice>.lock  (both slices' locks live here)
#     <root>/.claude/worktrees/<harness slice>             a real worktree INSIDE that repo
